  "notes": "A new app icon.\n\n## Changed\n- **The app icon is the Viking ship from the hero illustration**, replacing the green thumbs-up the app has carried since its 2019 Electron days. It shows in the Windows taskbar and Start menu, the macOS Dock and Finder, Linux launchers, and on every installer. The sidebar logo inside the app is unchanged.\n\nInstallers for Windows, macOS (Apple Silicon and Intel) and Linux are attached by the release workflow; existing installs update themselves. On some desktops the old icon stays cached until you log out or restart."
